      "last": {
        "speaker": 3,
        "line": 1069,
        "text": "Walt Kowalski once said to me I didn't know anything about life or death because ‘I was an overeducated, 27-year-old virgin who held the hands of superstitious old women and promised them eternity.' Walt definitely had no problem ‘calling it like he saw it.' But Walt was right."
      }
